<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DORBYL APPOINTS TWO NEW DIRECTORS.</title>
<headline>DORBYL APPOINTS TWO NEW DIRECTORS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group Dorbyl Ltd announced on Thursday it had appointed Martin Parry chief executive of its Automotive Aftermarket Division.</p>
<p>At the same time, Gordon Odgers had been appointed chief executive of automotive parts firm Midas Ltd .</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
